#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:224
msgid ""
"Administrator-managed durable policy. Source allow entries provide explicit trusted access, permanent block"
" entries stop the source before WordPress routing, and exact request exceptions scope automatic profile "
"matching. Smart adaptive response stays in its adaptive layer, while this section remains fully "
"administrator-controlled with self-lockout protection."
msgstr ""
"Kebijakan tahan lama yang dikelola administrator. Entri source allow memberi akses tepercaya eksplisit, "
"entri permanent block menghentikan sumber sebelum routing WordPress, dan pengecualian exact request "
"membatasi pencocokan profil otomatis. Smart adaptive response tetap berada di layer adaptifnya, sementara "
"bagian ini sepenuhnya dikendalikan administrator dengan perlindungan self-lockout."

